{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "poke-engine",
    "description": "API REST para gestion de Pokemons y sistema de combate por turnos.\n\nVariables de coleccion:\n- `base_url`: http://127.0.0.1:8000\n- `pokemon_id`: ID de BasePokemon (default: 1)\n- `move_id`: ID de Move (default: 1)\n- `my_pokemon_id`: ID de MyPokemon (default: 1)\n- `battle_id`: ID de Battle (default: 1)\n\nFlujo recomendado:\n1. Calcular daño (sin persistir)\n2. Atrapar un Pokemon (POST /my-pokemon/catch/)\n3. Crear batalla (POST /battles/)\n4. Ejecutar turnos (POST /battles/{id}/turn/)\n5. Ver estado final (GET /battles/{id}/)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "pokemon_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "move_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "my_pokemon_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "battle_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
